 rose in 11 of 12 months.","t_rain":"Rain and snow: no clear long-term change","p_rain":"El Paso's yearly precipitation shows no clear long-term change (\u22120.04 inches per decade, a range that includes zero). The 1991\u20132020 normal is 8.8 inches a year. The wettest year was 1884 (18.29 in); the driest, 1891 (2.22 in).","show_snow":true,"sig_bars":{"lo":true,"hi":true},"t_year":"2026 so far: 19 daily record highs, no daily record lows"}}